WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.729
The pot crashed to the floor.

2
00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:07.110
Tom fell too.

3
00:00:07.111 --> 00:00:09.815
"Oops!" Tom cried.

4
00:00:09.816 --> 00:00:12.588
He landed in a puddle of milk.

5
00:00:12.589 --> 00:00:17.191
Someone was laughing.

6
00:00:17.192 --> 00:00:19.770
It was the mouse.

7
00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:24.012
"You're in big trouble!" the mouse said.

8
00:00:24.013 --> 00:00:28.367
"The farmer's wife was going to make cheese.

9
00:00:28.368 --> 00:00:32.882
But you spilled all the milk!"

10
00:00:32.883 --> 00:00:36.420
"I will clean it up," Tom said.

11
00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:39.556
"How?" the mouse asked.

12
00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:42.561
Tom stuck out his tongue.

13
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:46.678
"I will lick up all the milk."

14
00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.470
"Ha-ha!" the mouse said.

15
00:00:49.471 --> 00:00:53.665
"That is too much milk for you!"

16
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:58.387
But Tom was already licking up milk.

17
00:00:58.388 --> 00:01:09.005
"Mmm," Tom said. "This milk is good!"

18
00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:13.601
"I will have some too," the mouse said.

19
00:01:13.602 --> 00:01:19.253
Tom and the mouse drank and drank.

20
00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:31.247
"Ooh," Tom said. "My belly hurts."

21
00:01:31.248 --> 00:01:40.484
But Tom kept drinking and drinking and drinking . . .

